{
  "url": "https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/06/25/the-beatles-on-our-world-all-you-need-is-love/",
  "type": "history",
  "slug": "the-beatles-on-our-world-all-you-need-is-love",
  "title": "25 June 1967: The Beatles on Our World: All You Need Is Love",
  "date": "1967-06-25",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></span> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/06/25/the-beatles-on-our-world-all-you-need-is-love/2/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></a></div><p>With seemingly unstoppable momentum during the summer of 1967, on 18 May The Beatles signed a contract to represent the BBC, and Britain, on <em>Our World</em>, the world’s first live television satellite link-up to be seen by approximately 400 million people across five continents. <span id=\"more-3013\"></span></p><p>The Beatles’ appearance was announced four days later, on 22 May. <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> wrote the song <a href=\"/songs/all-you-need-is-love/\">‘All You Need Is Love’</a> especially for the occasion, to the brief given by the BBC: it had to be simple so that viewers around the world would understand it.</p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe id=\"_ytid_83147\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\" data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"326\" data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Mki34tyoCp0?enablejsapi=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;cc_load_policy=0&amp;cc_lang_pref=&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0&amp;fs=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;autohide=2&amp;theme=dark&amp;color=red&amp;controls=1&amp;disablekb=0&amp;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\" allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><blockquote><div>We were big enough to command an audience of that size, and it was for love. It was for love and bloody peace. It was a fabulous time. I even get excited now when I realise that’s what it was for: peace and love, people putting flowers in guns.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\"><a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo Starr</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/anthologypb\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Anthology</em></a></div><p><em>Our World</em> took place on 25 June 1967. Between the announcement and the broadcast date, The Beatles recorded the rhythm track and some basic vocals.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/06/25/the-beatles-on-our-world-all-you-need-is-love/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-3013 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_all_you_need_is_love/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_all_you_need_is_love-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"All You Need Is Love single artwork - Japan\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_all_you_need_is_love-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_all_you_need_is_love-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_all_you_need_is_love-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_all_you_need_is_love.jpg 717w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9553\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_all_you_need_is_love/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_all_you_need_is_love.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"717,716\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"All You Need Is Love single artwork – Japan\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_all_you_need_is_love.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/yugoslavia_all_you_need_is_love/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_all_you_need_is_love-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"All You Need Is Love single - Yugoslavia\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_all_you_need_is_love-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_all_you_need_is_love-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_all_you_need_is_love-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_all_you_need_is_love-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_all_you_need_is_love-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_all_you_need_is_love.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10292\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/yugoslavia_all_you_need_is_love/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_all_you_need_is_love.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,1000\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"All You Need Is Love single – Yugoslavia\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/yugoslavia_all_you_need_is_love-960x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/denmark_all_you_need_is_love/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_all_you_need_is_love-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"All You Need Is Love single artwork - Denmark\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_all_you_need_is_love-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_all_you_need_is_love-580x576.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_all_you_need_is_love-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_all_you_need_is_love.jpg 717w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9249\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/denmark_all_you_need_is_love/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_all_you_need_is_love.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"717,712\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"All You Need Is Love single artwork – Denmark\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_all_you_need_is_love.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>The satellite link-up was devised by the BBC, which took the idea to the European Broadcasting Union in 1966. The project editor was BBC executive Aubrey Singer. Personalities, including Maria Callas and Pablo Picasso, from 19 nations performed in separate items from their respective countries. The event, which lasted two-and-a-half hours, had the largest television audience to date.</p><p>No politicians or heads of state were allowed to take part in the broadcast, and no pre-recorded videotape or film was allowed. Around 10,000 technicians, producers and translators helped make the event happen; each country had its own announcers, with translators narrating where necessary.</p><blockquote><div>For the first time ever, linking five continents and bringing man face to face with mankind, in places as far apart as Canberra and Cape Kennedy, Moscow and Montreal, Samarkand and Söderfors, Takamatsu and Tunis.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">BBC publicity</div><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/06/25/the-beatles-on-our-world-all-you-need-is-love/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-2\" class=\"gallery galleryid-3013 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670625-beatles-brian-epstein_06/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTMzIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzMyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"133\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670625-beatles-brian-epstein_06-200x133.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles with Brian Epstein, 25 June 1967 (photo: David Magnus)\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-2-23530\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670625-beatles-brian-epstein_06-200x133.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670625-beatles-brian-epstein_06-580x385.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670625-beatles-brian-epstein_06-960x638.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670625-beatles-brian-epstein_06-768x510.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670625-beatles-brian-epstein_06.jpg 1177w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-